---
title:    "Programming with Narrowing: a Tutorial"
citation: "(JSC 2010)"
url:      "http://web.cecs.pdx.edu/~antoy/homepage/publications/narrowing/paper.pdf"
date:     2010-05-01
---
This paper surveys the use of narrowing, i.e.,
the operational principle of Curry,
from a programmer viewpoint by means of examples.